RAW FILE
  PASS - order_id not duplicated
  PASS - no empty cells
  FAIL - qty is whole and positive number
  PASS - dates are real dates
  FAIL - price is numeric
AFTER FIX
  PASS - order_id not duplicated
  PASS - no empty cells
  PASS - qty is whole and positive number
  PASS - dates are real dates
  PASS - price is numeric
DELIBERATELY BROKEN COPY
  FAIL - order_id not duplicated
  FAIL - no empty cells
  FAIL - qty is whole and positive number
  FAIL - dates are real dates
  FAIL - price is numeric
